==Battleground==
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Selena]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
**1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You should try to bring anti-Red units such as [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to deal with the St. Pigge the 2nd, while using [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] to stunlock Selena and the Dark Otters. Nukers like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] can help occasionally clear the field of enemies.

